# Ruleset: Better Stack
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# The dashboard, incidents and the MCP server. Named so its exit is the profile's proxy policy instead of whatever the catch-all group is switched to. Log ingestion under betterstackdata.com is named here too, so our own log shipping keeps the same exit.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,betterstack.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,betterstackdata.com
